Package: proteomicAge
Type: Package
Title: Proteomic Aging Clocks
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-06-18
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Xiaohan", family = "Han",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "xiaohan@clawbio.org")
  )
Author: Xiaohan Han
Maintainer: Xiaohan Han <xiaohan@clawbio.org>
Description: Compute biological age from plasma proteomic data using
    published proteomic aging clocks. Currently implements proteomic
    age models from Tanaka et al. (2018), Lehallier et al. (2019),
    Sathyan et al. (2020), Oh et al. (2023), Wang et al. (2024),
    Kuo et al. PAC (2024), and Goeminne et al. Olink organ-aging
    models, plus a Global proteomic age ensemble. All computation is local;
    proteomic data never leaves the machine.
